Agentic AI in Action: MyIAM Chatbot 

Development is underway for the MyIAM AI Chatbot, which goes beyond a traditional chatbot by combining Generative and Agentic AI capabilities, leveraging the ITG Twin Agentic framework. 

The Agent uses RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) to answer questions about MyIAM processes, while read-only Agentic capabilities are being developed to address more contextual, user-specific queries, with the required security and access controls. 

Designed for MyIAM end users, the initiative aims to help users access the IAM information they need and find answers more independently, improving the overall MyIAM user experience while helping to reduce repetitive queries handled by the Support team. 

More broadly, the initiative represents an important step towards the adoption of Agentic AI within IAM, providing a foundation for future AI-enabled IAM use cases. 

The MyIAM AI Chatbot is not yet live. Stay tuned for updates! 


